+ ## First-success path
+ The shortest truthful path is:
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ./notesctl run --no-status
+ ./notesctl install --minutes 30 --load
+ ./notesctl verify
+ ./notesctl doctor
+ ./notesctl status --full
